  "details": "Since december a few worlds mainly popcorn palace and japan shrine give me the vrhat stopped responding error, when pressing ok it just trys to rejoin the world over and over sending me into a loop where i get the error on repeat forcing me to close vrchat so i can join another world. \n\nIf i do manage to load into said worlds i will sometimes get the error a few minutes later and that will continue to happen for ages as well, and making a new instance of popcorn palace doesnt fix it. However joining any other world makes it stop somehow. \n\nI do not experience this infinite loop of errors in any other world but i propose to mitigate the issue of being in a perpetual loop that the error screen gives the option to return to your home world",
